WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.699
Your AI assistant knows a lot about code.

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:06.957
A plugin teaches it how to
build on Power Platform.

00:00:07.327 --> 00:00:10.646
You install a plugin once,
and it adds a set of skills.

00:00:11.016 --> 00:00:14.310
Each skill is one job,
written down step by step.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.044
Creating a Power Pages site is one skill.

00:00:17.114 --> 00:00:18.777
Deploying it is another.

00:00:19.147 --> 00:00:20.889
When you describe what you need,

00:00:20.889 --> 00:00:24.352
your assistant picks the right
skill and follows its steps.

00:00:24.422 --> 00:00:27.582
It asks before it runs
commands or changes files.

00:00:27.952 --> 00:00:32.514
So, plugins are what you install,
and skills are the jobs inside them.

00:00:32.584 --> 00:00:33.798
You just ask.
